        "content": "The argument `sep=\"\"` is a _keyword argument_, and its name is short for _separator_. It specifies that the other arguments should now be separated by an empty string. You can set the separator to any string you like. For example, if you wanted each argument on a separate line, you could set the separator to `\"\\n\"`, which is the newline character:"
